{"id":"en_divine-blood-in-dust","title":"Divine Blood in Dust","titleEn":"Divine Blood in Dust","description":"Hebe, a goddess, comes down to earth to wed the driven Jason, only to endure mistreatment at his hands—cruelty that persists even through her pregnancy and is fueled by the sorceress Medea's magic. When her brothers Ares, Apollo, and Hermes step forward to disclose who she truly is, Hebe takes back her godhood, removes Jason's authority entirely, and ascends to Olympus in victory. Those who wronged her are left to waste away in suffering. This story blends divine vengeance with a powerful rebirth.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/divine-blood-in-dust/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/divine-blood-in-dust/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Alternate History","Immortal Love","Karma","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7duocw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_divine-blood-in-dust_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7duocw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_divine-blood-in-dust_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7duocw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_divine-blood-in-dust_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7duocw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_divine-blood-in-dust_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7duocw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_divi